        "This is my only hope."
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "egp_id": "1741163708328x809057828256698500",
    "level": "C1",
    "super_category": "CLAUSES",
    "sub_category": "coordinated",
    "lexical_range": "N/A",
    "guideword": "FORM/USE: 'NOT ONLY \u2026 BUT (ALSO)' WITH INVERSION, FOCUS",
    "can_do_statement": "Can combine clauses using 'not only' in front position followed by an inverted first clause + \u2026 'but (also)' to introduce the second clause, to give focus.",
    "ontology": {
      "domain": "EPISTEMIC_STANCE",
      "mental_model": "Emphatic addition with formal inversion",
